              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "пешка (péshka) — \"a pawn\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Пешка — самая слабая фигура в шахматах. Péshka — sámaya slábaya figúra v shákhmatakh. The pawn is the weakest piece in chess."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine. Figuratively, a person of no importance."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "пешка (péshka) is built on пеший 'on foot', so a pawn is a foot soldier; EtymDB lists пешка (péshka) without a source."
